+"""
+Functional TriMul baseline.
+
+The implementation mirrors the PyTorch reference directly: layer-normalize the
+pair representation, form left/right projections and gates, contract over the
+shared sequence index, normalize the hidden channels, apply the output gate, and
+project back to the input channel dimension.
